Tests a practical hybrid: quicksort with safe pivoting and a deterministic fallback to a stable merge, matching patterns in production sort libraries.

## Key Concepts
- 3-way partition quicksort to handle duplicates efficiently
- Median-of-three pivot to reduce degenerate pivots
- Tail recursion elimination to reduce stack usage
- Depth-limited fallback to stable mergesort with O(n) extra space

